 C("PB-0216", "LEAD-M02", "P2", "03_PAGE_SECTIONS", "/providers/ NEW section (insert as section_order 2; renumber later sections +1)", "heading_en/body_en/heading_ar/body_ar",
   "(absent — the 'two central-bank authorities' fact appears only in /data/ and /finance/ chronology)",
   "EN heading: Whose list is this? || EN body: The current provider lists and status decisions on this page come from instruments issued by the Central Bank of Yemen in Aden. Since 2016 central-bank authority has been divided, and some banks on the current list have addresses in Sana'a and Taiz in the source. Status under any other authority is not established here; this defines the scope of the evidence and is not a judgement about either authority. Absence from a CBY-Aden list does not show that a provider is unlicensed elsewhere, and presence on it does not show that a provider can operate across all of Yemen. || AR heading: قائمة مَن هذه؟ || AR body: تأتي القوائم الحالية لمقدمي الخدمات وقرارات حالتهم في هذه الصفحة من وثائق صادرة عن البنك المركزي اليمني في عدن. ومنذ 2016 انقسمت سلطة البنك المركزي، وترد لبعض البنوك في القائمة الحالية عناوين في صنعاء وتعز بحسب المصدر. ولا تثبت هذه الصفحة وضع أي جهة لدى سلطة أخرى؛ فهذا تحديد لنطاق الدليل وليس حكمًا على أي من السلطتين. وغياب جهة عن قائمة البنك المركزي في عدن لا يعني أنها غير مرخصة في مكان آخر، كما أن ورودها فيها لا يعني أنها قادرة على العمل في كل أنحاء اليمن.",
   "both", "BOUNDARY_TIGHTENING", "14_SYSTEM_CHRONOLOGY: 2016 relocation left two central-bank authorities; 22_PROVIDERS_DATA listed addresses (e.g. Al-Zubairy Street, Sana'a; Jamal Street, Taiz).",
   "Divided supervisory authority is undisclosed on the provider page; the scope statement is a universe definition, not a political statement.",
   "/providers/ page; search_index", "Section renders in both languages above the exchange-roster section.", op="NEW", ia="New in-page section only; no route change"),
 C("PB-0217", "LEAD-M02", "P2", "22_PROVIDERS_DATA", "SCHEMA", "issuing_authority, territorial_scope (new columns)",
   "(only regulator_scope, e.g. CBY_ADEN_SUPERVISION_LIST)", "Populate per row from the row's source_id: CBY-Aden instruments → issuing_authority = CBY_ADEN; SRC-YMN-* (network membership) → NONE__NON_REGULATORY_SOURCE; rows without a source → UNKNOWN. territorial_scope = SOURCE_JURISDICTION_AS_STATED (never national by default). Render both on every provider record.",
   "n/a", "BOUNDARY_TIGHTENING", "22_PROVIDERS_DATA regulator_scope values.", "Makes authority scope a first-class field rather than a phrase.", "providers_data.json; /providers/; provider evidence records",
   "Every provider record shows issuing authority and scope.", op="SCHEMA"),

